{
  "description": "Only the inheritable and inherits responses declare a config's slug and its inheritance state, and they declare `inherits` and `inheritedBy` as arrays with no item schema. Every config endpoint returns the same config object: a live GET /v3/configs/config on 2026-10-13 returned slug, inheritable, inheriting, inherits and inheritedBy, and GET /v3/configs returned every one of them except inheritedBy. Both clients read the same object from create, rename, clone, lock and unlock (DopplerHQ/cli pkg/models/parse.go:107-155; DopplerHQ/terraform-provider-doppler doppler/models.go:247-266), and both read inherits and inheritedBy items as {project, config} (DopplerHQ/cli pkg/models/parse.go:142-150).",
